---
import Base from "../layouts/Base.astro";
---

<Base
  title="About Rotaract Europe"
  description="What E.R.I.C. is, when it started, and how the board and country representatives work."
>
  <main id="content" class="wrap">
    <header class="page-head">
      <p class="kicker">About</p>
      <h1>A European network since Antwerp</h1>
      <p class="lede">
        Rotaract Europe was founded in 1988 at the first European Convention in Antwerp. Representatives from 15 countries formed the first European committee.
      </p>
    </header>
    <div class="year">
      <strong>1988</strong>
      <p>E.R.I.C. is founded. The first committee brings together Belgium, Denmark, Finland, France, Germany, Greece, Italy, Malta, the Netherlands, Norway, Portugal, Spain, Sweden, Switzerland, and Turkey.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="year">
      <strong>1993</strong>
      <p>Rotary International recognises E.R.I.C. as a multi-district information organisation, the first international MDIO.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="year">
      <strong>Now</strong>
      <p>Country representatives from across Europe form the General Assembly. They elect a board each year to run events, service, partnerships, and communication.</p>
    </div>

    <h2>What the network is for</h2>
    <div class="grid-2">
      <article class="panel">
        <h3>Exchange knowledge</h3>
        <p>Share what works between districts, clubs, and members.</p>
      </article>
      <article class="panel">
        <h3>Foster friendship</h3>
        <p>Give Rotaractors a reason to cross a border and stay in touch afterwards.</p>
      </article>
      <article class="panel">
        <h3>Create impact</h3>
        <p>Back service projects that are stronger because more than one country is in them.</p>
      </article>
      <article class="panel">
        <h3>Strengthen Rotary</h3>
        <p>Keep Rotaract and Rotary International in the same conversation.</p>
      </article>
    </div>

    <h2>The year, in three rooms</h2>
    <div class="grid-3">
      <article class="panel">
        <h3>REM, autumn</h3>
        <p>September or October. A regional meeting: the assembly, a host city, and a gala.</p>
      </article>
      <article class="panel">
        <h3>REM, winter</h3>
        <p>January. The second regional meeting. The presidential election is held here.</p>
      </article>
      <article class="panel">
        <h3>EUCO</h3>
        <p>May or June. The European convention, five days, and the election of the rest of the board.</p>
      </article>
    </div>
  </main>
</Base>
